<div style="flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9">②席位 <span style="color:#4caf7d">同意</span><br><b style="color:#d8dee9">修复·升</b><br><span style="color:#5c6674">权31%·准确率6/26</span></div>
