<div style="flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #e05d5d;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9">④产逻 <span style="color:#e05d5d">反对</span><br><b style="color:#e05d5d">退潮·降</b><br><span style="color:#5c6674">权45%·准确率12/28</span></div>
<div style="flex:1;min-width:100px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #2a2f3a;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;color:#d8dee9">⑤质量 <span style="color:#4caf7d">同意</span><br><b style="color:#d8dee9">修复·平</b><br><span style="color:#5c6674">权39%·准确率10/28</span></div>
